{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51cfc8a46746f6af3ed8b2e03fd86b14c3512a4b76e2d7036b247efff7330426", "ja": "（南国リゾートでのウェディング撮影が終わった。\n明るい日差しの中、紗代子は輝いて見えた……）", "zh": "（南国度假胜地的婚礼写真拍摄结束了。\n在明媚的阳光下，纱代子看起来熠熠生辉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a2dc892e9f5ad26303d3e587d7eb79e65788b57a632addb16810fbc94f4f67a3", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。撮影終わった\nばかりなのに、散歩に付き合ってもらって。", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}。明明才刚结束拍摄，就让你陪我出来散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "969bc666ee3238d93e14a999b5154e8cd83a9043e26058a5d743b9dc72535dee", "ja": "いいよ、俺も歩きたかったし。\nどうする？　もう少し遠くまで行くか？", "zh": "没事的，我也正好想散散步。\n接下来怎么走？要去稍微远一点的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "c4008c2ca999f5f10acb1cb34873812983ba9e8a9c093c071995c98a6cd1581a", "ja": "あ、それなら……撮影で使った向こうのチャペルまで、\nいいですか？　もう一度見たかったなって。", "zh": "啊，那样的话……去那边拍摄时用过的教堂，\n可以吗？我还想再去看一次来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "6d94d1dcf2d6aa3c8eb19b9deab6d38dd9358f5d7e011fde0976d8d5ab8e78bd", "ja": "チャペル自体も素敵でしたけど、\nハイビスカスの花壇が、とっても綺麗で……♪", "zh": "小教堂本身也很漂亮，不过朱槿花坛特别美……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "32e0c90dfa43e65fe17e4fe9e948adda5c4fc7787b18a544cd2f13ceb30ee468", "ja": "そうだな、凄く綺麗だった。\nでも綺麗って言うなら、紗代子も負けてなかったぞ！", "zh": "是啊，真的很漂亮。\n不过要说漂亮的话，纱代子也毫不逊色哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "f548a5e308ff402164bb43843665f917bf3b194e5f0964f7d75fb519700a62bf", "ja": "え……わ、私が！？　そ、そんないきなり……！\nええと……あ、あはは。", "zh": "诶……我、我吗！？怎、怎么突然说这个……！\n那个……啊、啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "2e0c1674e1bd333b824d6285f18e9286bb71fe227b09ba1ac72245c0650df63d", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n嬉しいです。ちょっとビックリしましたけど。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n我很开心。虽然刚才稍微有点吓到了就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3f3afe5a2163874556a8613956c94faf74868f8a54358da85714666d13c0cefa", "ja": "本当だよ。いい笑顔が撮れたって、スタッフの\n評判も良かったんだ。きっといい写真になる。", "zh": "真的。工作人员都说拍到了很棒的笑容，评价也很好。肯定能拍出一张好照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "ffc0ad3a96471987209891adbe57c4f571c441e29b494bb8bdc03c24b5399f0a", "ja": "よかった……。正直、最初は自信なかったんです。\n高校生の私が、ウェディングの格好なんて、って。", "zh": "太好了……其实我一开始真的没什么自信。\n还在想身为高中生的我，穿成新娘的模样会不会不太合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "293ce09423a426daef05942449d1aec9e154e661a90c747a493e5e0d76e62596", "ja": "でも、ドレスを着て、ビーチの風に吹かれて\nいるうちに、だんだん元気が出てきたんです！", "zh": "不过，穿上礼服迎着海滩的风时，不知不觉就渐渐打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "238eaa809d3579a8aa8f0c954b5b0a5cbd69d93bb39caa7c1f20fe753bc335db", "ja": "そうか……でも今日の紗代子は、元気っていうより、\nしっとりした感じだったな。", "zh": "这样啊……不过今天的纱代子，与其说是精神十足，不如说给人一种娴静的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "82aa55a4b0724433d415ea424539866f05c879f6b38201896a8cd2711ea079ae", "ja": "そうかも……頑張ろう！って感じじゃなくて。\nだけど少しずつ、元気で嬉しい気持ちになって……。", "zh": "可能是吧……并不是那种“要加油！”的感觉。\n不过，我渐渐变得精神起来，也感到开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "f9b914dd0e61bc9630afb91f987a88547d43654ccc50f092269c064c85b5168a", "ja": "私もここにいていいんだ、って、自然に思えてきて。\nなんだかちょっと不思議ですけど。", "zh": "我也开始自然而然地觉得，待在这里也是可以的。\n虽然感觉有点不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "789ca469530964a781b67e3d862b438a77d5f7643df0220b914b1d58afe384f2", "ja": "もしかしたら、本物の花嫁さんも\n結婚する時、そんな気持ちになるんでしょうか？", "zh": "或许真正的新娘在结婚的时候，也会产生这样的心情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1015_p", "source_sha256": "38ecbe2f0480e884e59ae327671969e5aebc7f09095a3f84445053165f8958a1", "ja": "ここに居ていい……居場所。\nそうだな、そういうものかもしれない。", "zh": "可以待在这里……属于自己的位置。\n是啊，或许就是这样的感觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "d2d45ff74c611a8c48418d7f5da85b03ccb5e3e8c1741acd44236066c9ee0924", "ja": "私……また、あのチャペルを訪れたいです。\nいつか、本物の結婚式をする時に。", "zh": "我……还想再去那座小教堂。\n等到有一天，举办真正的婚礼的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1017_p", "source_sha256": "31c25d7595fd56315b35f80043d1a2bcd16b24d0ac28b7fb92c9ef593f74fffe", "ja": "うん、その時は……よかったら、呼んでくれ。\n末席で構わないから。", "zh": "嗯，到那个时候……如果不介意的话，就请叫上我吧。\n哪怕是最末席也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "49c535ffccf341624f2194587ebef8fcf2ac3f47688ebc6ea8e387905d86b858", "ja": "末席なんて、そんな。{$P$}は\n私の隣です！　あっ……そうじゃなくて、ええと……！", "zh": "怎么能坐末席呢。{$P$}应该在我身边！啊……不是这个意思，那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "4add1fcf19593c887653bc9381a50b0b268f7f4db61111bf2583d66fc7e393c2", "ja": "離れて見守るんじゃなくて、近くにいて欲しいです。\nその方が……私、心強いですから。", "zh": "我不想让您只在远处守望，而是希望您能陪在我身边。\n这样的话……我会更有勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4de0454a784bc916a0aaae4fbccb0b93a57d63879098e0db0ccf9d212b34b6e7", "ja": "はは、そうか。わかった。\nできるだけ近くに居られるように、頑張るよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。我明白了。\n我会努力尽量陪在你身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0233_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "7868207db6dfb4d5cba6fe510a14e778e54d826a2dea28001cf1e0f1f54df6cf", "ja": "は、はい……ええと、それじゃ行きましょう！\nどっちが速いか、競争しましょうか？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "好、好的……呃，那我们走吧！\n要不要比比看谁更快？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
